  "description": "After a wild night at the club, Gyuha wakes up to a surprise. He's tangled in the sheets with none other than his childhood friend, Chayoung. The more Gyuha thinks about it, the more he realizes that Chayoung is actually his ideal type, maybe a tad too tall. Despite their rendezvous becoming a regular thing, and the chemistry between them getting steamier, Chayoung is still dead set on marrying an omega. Too bad he doesn't know Gyuha is not the beta he's pretending to be. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
